    "\n",
    "    For each rank r, compute:\n",
    "      - Params per LoRA layer: r*(d+d) = 2*r*d  (square matrices)\n",
    "      - Total LoRA params: n_layers × target_modules × 2rd\n",
    "      - Full fine-tune params: n_layers × target_modules × d²\n",
    "      - Ratio: LoRA / full\n",
